These data copy `../source/WordWitnesses.json`, with the original subgroup,
representatives and transporter conventions unchanged. Every identity is checked
in the following modules. The sorted enumeration uses only consecutive numerical
comparisons, rather than quadratic pairwise matrix comparisons.

Source application: Aschbacher–Smith K.1.3, printed p.453 / PDF p.464.
ATLAS attribution and licensing: `LICENSES/ATLAS.txt` and
`LICENSES/ATLAS-CITATION.cff`. Regenerate with `source/Generate.py`.
-/

